  "description": "HortiApi.Client.Rest is a RESTful client library for the HortiAPI, built upon the standardized models offered by HortiApi.Models. It simplifies integration with the horticulture industry's unified API by providing ready-to-use REST implementations. This allows developers to efficiently connect and interact with various stakeholders through a single, generic API.",
